n. The access point control, a circular button with a diagonal rocket symbol, sits in the upper corner on the leading edge.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/9774fc7f07482493ee1559593dc08e53/games-access-point-collapsed%402x.png","line":34,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration composed of an iPhone screenshot and an iPad screenshot, both of the game The Coast, with the Game Overlay appearing over the top of each. In the iPhone screenshot the overlay covers the entire screen, while in the iPad screenshot the overlay appears vertically on the trailing edge.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/bd606a6020d893c8275928bfcf22bc36/games-game-overlay%402x.png","line":38,"embedded":true},{"title":"Adding an access point to your game","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameKit/adding-an-access-point-to-your-game#Configure-the-access-point-on-visionOS","line":48},{"title":"Using custom UI","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-center#Using-custom-UI","line":52},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/#technologies","line":56},{"title":"Achievements","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-center#Achievements","line":69},{"title":"Rewarding players with achievements","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameKit/rewarding-players-with-achievements","line":71},{"title":"An iPhone screenshot of the game The Coast with the Game Overlay open, showing the Achievements overview screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/026715959db42c83de8cc04dc399dd03/games-achievement-overlay%402x.png","line":73,"embedded":true},{"title":"An iPhone screenshot of the game The Coast with the Game Overlay open, showing the detail view of a single achievement.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/fa2b92d24d82b3cae0748a731df621e8/games-achievemen