ngle leaderboard.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/825cea7230ad7958b60f681aef7bb407/games-leaderboards-detail%402x.png","line":132,"embedded":true},{"title":"Focus and selection","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/focus-and-selection","line":170},{"title":"Apple Design Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/#tvos-apps","line":170},{"title":"A diagram of the layout for a leaderboard image in iOS, iPadOS, and macOS, with callouts indicating the image size and mask diameter.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a41db2a595bec653175fcfb13b50b9ed/leaderboard-image-layout-general%402x.png","line":177,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram of the layout for a leaderboard image in tvOS, with callouts indicating the image size, focused size, and unfocused size.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/631b5255803637a7084fe167f971810c/tvos-multi-layered-leaderboard-image%402x.png","line":187,"embedded":true},{"title":"Challenges","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-center#Challenges","line":202},{"title":"Creating engaging challenges from leaderboards","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameKit/creating-engaging-challenges-from-leaderboards","line":204},{"title":"An iPhone screenshot of the game The Coast with the Game Overlay open, showing the Challenges overview screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/63176e29afb5351d511719cafdf1bb0d/games-challenges-overlay%402x.png","line":206,"embedded":true},{"title":"An iPhone screenshot of the game The Coast with the Game Overlay open, showing the detail view of a single challenge.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ddfb071869dd7577f3e43f955f1b6ce7/games-challenges-overlay-detail%402x.png","line":210,"embedded":true},{"title":"A diagram of a challenge card, with callouts indicating the challen